rd the build credits used and keep separate cloud or deployed-AI usage out of the comparison."}]]}]]}],["$","li","Introduce one controlled regression",{"className":"grid gap-4 py-7 sm:grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] sm:gap-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground","children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight","children":"Introduce one controlled regression"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-7 text-muted-foreground","children":"Ask for a narrow follow-up edit, inspect unrelated files, then restore an earlier version. The goal is to measure edit containment and recovery—not just initial generation speed."}]]}]]}],["$","li","Export and run locally",{"className":"grid gap-4 py-7 sm:grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] sm:gap-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground","children":"04"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight","children":"Export and run locally"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-7 text-muted-foreground","children":"Download both projects, install from a clean directory, run the documented commands, and test the same routes and interactions outside each builder's preview."}]]}]]}]]}]]}]
25:["$","div",null,{"className":"divide-y divide-border border-y border-border","children":[["$","section","The outdated comparison is 'export versus lock-in'",{"id":"the-outdated-comparison-is-export-versus-lock-in","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-12 sm:py-14","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-[4rem_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-8","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-sm text-primary","children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-balance text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] sm:text-3xl","children":"The outdated comparison is 'export versus lock-in'"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-[1.05rem] leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Lovable supports full-project ZIP downloads and GitHub synchronization, and its documentation describes standard Vite + React projects that can run outside Lovable. Squid also treats portability as foundational, but differentiates through the evidence packed around the export: a file manifest, generated-code quality report, bundle verification report, run instructions, and starter deployment configuration."}],"$undefined"]}]]}]}],["$","section","The sharper question is what arrives with the code",{"id":"the-sharper-question-is-what-arrives-with-the-code","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-12 sm:py-14","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-[4rem_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-8","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-sm text-primary","children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-balance text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] sm:text-3xl","children":"The sharper question is what arrives with the code"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-[1.05rem] leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"A source archive is necessary, but it does not prove the app installs cleanly or explain what the generator checked. Squid assembles missing runtime support files, infers dependencies used